  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "hf-papers-wiki",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\ud83e\udde0 HF Papers Wiki\n\t\n\nA persistent, compounding knowledge base about the Hugging Face open-source ML ecosystem \u2014 built and maintained by an LLM agent following the LLM Wiki pattern.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tWhat Is This?\n\t\n\nThis is a structured, interlinked wiki covering the foundational papers, models, training techniques, datasets, and organizations of the open-source LLM ecosystem. It was seeded from 21 landmark papers and has grown through 32 ingestion batches to 280 papers and 407 total\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/tbukuai/hf-papers-wiki.",
